OL,3,CBlogger Perez Hilton under medical
OL,4,Ccare after harming himself on
OL,5,Clivestream
OL,7,FWarning: This article contains details
OL,8,Fsome readers may find distressing.
OL,10,FAmerican blogger Perez Hilton is
OL,11,Freceiving medical care, his family
OL,12,Fhave said, after he appeared to harm
OL,13,Fhimself during a livestream on social
OL,14,Fmedia.
OL,16,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,17,FHilton's home in Miami on Tuesday
OL,18,Fnight after they received reports of a
OL,19,Fman "livestreaming acts of self-harm"
OL,20,Fonline.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
