OL,3,CBlogger Perez Hilton under medical
OL,4,Ccare after harming himself on
OL,5,Clivestream
OL,7,FThe Miami-Dade Sheriff's Office did
OL,8,Fnot name Hilton, real name Mario
OL,9,FArmando Lavandeira Jr, but said a man
OL,10,Fhad been "safely recovered" and taken
OL,11,Fto a nearby hospital by the fire
OL,12,Fservice.
OL,14,FThey said that the man had been home
OL,15,Falone at the time of the livestream.
OL,17,FOn Wednesday, Hilton's family thanked
OL,18,Fmembers of the public for their
OL,19,Fconcern and confirmed Hilton is
OL,20,Freceiving medical care.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
