OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,F"Many of you have reached out with
OL,13,Fconcern for Perez, and we are
OL,14,Fincredibly grateful for the
OL,15,Foverwhelming outpouring of love,
OL,16,Fsupport, and prayers," read a
OL,17,Fstatement, posted on Perez's website.
