OL,3,CBlogger Perez Hilton under medical
OL,4,Ccare after harming himself on
OL,5,Clivestream
OL,7,F"We can confirm that Perez is
OL,8,Freceiving medical care, and our
OL,9,Ffamily's focus right now is on his
OL,10,Fwell-being.
OL,12,F"We kindly ask that you respect
OL,13,FPerez's privacy, as well as the
OL,14,Fprivacy of his family, during this
OL,15,Fdifficult time.
OL,17,F"If and when we are able to share any
OL,18,Fupdates, we will do so with everyone
OL,19,Fas soon as we can."
