OL,3,CBlogger Perez Hilton under medical
OL,4,Ccare after harming himself on
OL,5,Clivestream
OL,7,FHilton became famous in the early
OL,8,F2000s after launching his hugely
OL,9,Fpopular blog 'Perez Hilton', which
OL,10,Fdocumented celebrity gossip and
OL,11,Fentertainment news.
OL,13,FThe blog often gained controversy, as
OL,14,FHilton did not hesitate to criticise
OL,15,Fcelebrities he did not like.
OL,17,FEarlier this year, Hilton shared that
OL,18,Fhe had been hospitalised for three
OL,19,Fweeks after developing sepsis from a
OL,20,Fperforated stomach ulcer.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
